# A data heredoc naming a harness directory next to a construct the guard does
# not model (backticks): the guard must not remove the body as prose but check
# every word (fail closed, decided by the user; ADR-0037, ADR-0043)
command: cargo xtask guard
expect: could modify the harness file `xtask
stdin: {"session_id": "selftest", "tool_name": "Bash", "tool_input": {"command": "git commit -F - <<'EOF'\nfix the xtask guard\nEOF\necho `date`"}, "hook_event_name": "PreToolUse"}
